# Gw Pectoral Aft Not Snout

In SharkVisuals GreatWhiteBody and StandardSharkBody, sickle pectorals must originate just aft of the 5th gill and sweep AFT (lower x toward the tail) and DOWN. Never point the pectoral tip toward the snout. Match IMG_2272 for all fins, head, caudal, and jagged charcoal/white boundary. Do not modify reference PNGs.

